  type: 1
  description: 
  sentences:
    nameNPC: "\u0110\xE0m Th\u1ECB"
    Lines:
    - "Gi\u1EEFa d\xF2ng n\u01B0\u1EDBc d\u1EEF, s\xE0o tre c\u1EE7a \u0110\xE0m
      Th\u1ECB v\u01B0\u01A1n ra nh\u01B0ng qu\xE1 xa. \u0110inh Ho\xE0n kh\xF4ng
      ho\u1EA3ng lo\u1EA1n. C\u1EADu b\xE9 bi\u1EBFt m\xECnh kh\xF4ng th\u1EC3 b\xE1m
      v\xE0o \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c, c\u0169ng kh\xF4ng th\u1EC3 ch\u1ED1ng ch\u1ECDi
      v\u1EDBi s\u1EE9c n\u01B0\u1EDBc cu\u1ED3n cu\u1ED9n."
    - "Trong kho\u1EA3nh kh\u1EAFc sinh t\u1EED, m\u1ED9t \xFD ngh\u0129 l\xF3e l\xEAn
      trong \u0111\u1EA7u c\u1EADu: \"Ph\u1EA3i t\u1EF1 m\xECnh tho\xE1t ra!\" C\u1EADu
      g\u1ED3ng m\xECnh, h\xEDt m\u1ED9t h\u01A1i th\u1EADt s\xE2u v\xE0 l\u1EB7n
      s\xE2u xu\u1ED1ng, chui d\u01B0\u1EDBi g\u1EA7m xo\xE1y n\u01B0\u1EDBc. D\xE2n
      l\xE0ng n\xEDn th\u1EDF d\xF5i theo, kh\xF4ng ai d\xE1m tin v\xE0o m\u1EAFt
      m\xECnh."
